('u7_11_interviewee_meaning','vocab_interviewee','u7_11_interviewee','interviewee_1','meaning_context','The interviewee glanced at her notes, took a breath and began to answer the first question.',null,'["person who answers the questions"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_11_interviewee_paraphrase','vocab_interviewee','u7_11_interviewee','interviewee_1','paraphrase_context','The person who answers the questions glanced at her notes, took a breath and began to answer the first question.','person who answers the questions','["interviewee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_11_interviewee_production','vocab_interviewee','u7_11_interviewee','interviewee_1','production_context','A person being asked questions by a panel often feels more confident after the first easy answer.','person being asked questions by a panel','["interviewee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_11_interviewee_gap_1','vocab_interviewee','u7_11_interviewee','interviewee_1','gap_fill','A good interviewee prepares examples in advance and listens to each question before answering.','interviewee','["interviewee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_11_interviewee_gap_2','vocab_interviewee','u7_11_interviewee','interviewee_1','gap_fill','The panel noticed that the interviewee spoke clearly and did not repeat the same point.','interviewee','["interviewee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_11_interviewee_gap_3','vocab_interviewee','u7_11_interviewee','interviewee_1','gap_fill','By the end of the meeting, the interviewee felt that she had been given a fair chance to speak.','interviewee','["interviewee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_12_referee_meaning','vocab_referee','u7_12_referee','referee_1','meaning_context','Please give the name of a referee who has known you for at least two years.',null,'["person who speaks well of you to an employer"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_12_referee_paraphrase','vocab_referee','u7_12_referee','referee_1','paraphrase_context','Please give the name of a person who speaks well of you to an employer who has known you for at least two years.','person who speaks well of you to an employer','["referee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_12_referee_production','vocab_referee','u7_12_referee','referee_1','production_context','Choose someone who gives an opinion of your character and who will reply quickly to the employer’s email.','someone who gives an opinion of your character','["referee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_12_referee_gap_1','vocab_referee','u7_12_referee','referee_1','gap_fill','The company contacted Ali’s referee to ask whether he was honest and punctual.','referee','["referee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_12_referee_gap_2','vocab_referee','u7_12_referee','referee_1','gap_fill','You should ask permission before you give someone’s name as a referee on your application.','referee','["referee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_12_referee_gap_3','vocab_referee','u7_12_referee','referee_1','gap_fill','Her referee described her as patient, organised and very good with younger children.','referee','["referee"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_13_reference_meaning','vocab_reference','u7_13_reference','reference_1','meaning_context','The college asked for a reference from her last teacher before it offered her a place.',null,'["written opinion from someone who knows you"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
