('u7_16_availability_7_production','vocab_availability_7','u7_16_availability_7','availability_7_1','production_context','The organiser checked whether a person can attend each session before preparing the final timetable.','whether a person can attend','["availability"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_16_availability_7_gap_1','vocab_availability_7','u7_16_availability_7','availability_7_1','gap_fill','Before we fix a date for the interview, please let us know your availability during the next two weeks.','availability','["availability"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_16_availability_7_gap_2','vocab_availability_7','u7_16_availability_7','availability_7_1','gap_fill','The manager built the work timetable around each student’s availability after school.','availability','["availability"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_16_availability_7_gap_3','vocab_availability_7','u7_16_availability_7','availability_7_1','gap_fill','Her availability is limited to Tuesday and Thursday afternoons because she has classes on the other days.','availability','["availability"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_17_compromise_meaning','vocab_compromise','u7_17_compromise','compromise_1','meaning_context','After a long discussion, the two interviewers reached a compromise and offered the post to the second candidate.',null,'["agreement where both sides give something up"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_17_compromise_paraphrase','vocab_compromise','u7_17_compromise','compromise_1','paraphrase_context','After a long discussion, the two interviewers reached an agreement where both sides gave something up and offered the post to the second candidate.','agreement where both sides gave something up','["compromise"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_17_compromise_production','vocab_compromise','u7_17_compromise','compromise_1','production_context','In a group discussion, suggesting a middle solution that both sides accept can show that you are a good team member.','middle solution that both sides accept','["compromise"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_17_compromise_gap_1','vocab_compromise','u7_17_compromise','compromise_1','gap_fill','After weeks of argument, the company and the workers finally reached a compromise about working hours.','compromise','["compromise"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_17_compromise_gap_2','vocab_compromise','u7_17_compromise','compromise_1','gap_fill','A good interviewee shows that she can find a compromise when team members disagree.','compromise','["compromise"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_17_compromise_gap_3','vocab_compromise','u7_17_compromise','compromise_1','gap_fill','The only compromise that satisfied both families was to hold the party at a neutral venue.','compromise','["compromise"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_18_dominate_meaning','vocab_dominate','u7_18_dominate','dominate_1','meaning_context','In a group interview, you should avoid trying to dominate the conversation.',null,'["have the most control over"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_18_dominate_paraphrase','vocab_dominate','u7_18_dominate','dominate_1','paraphrase_context','In a group interview, you should avoid trying to take over by being the loudest in the conversation.','take over by being the loudest in','["dominate"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_18_dominate_production','vocab_dominate','u7_18_dominate','dominate_1','production_context','Large companies from a few countries have the most control over the world market for computer chips.','have the most control over','["dominate"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_18_dominate_gap_1','vocab_dominate','u7_18_dominate','dominate_1','gap_fill','A good team member listens and makes space for others instead of trying to dominate the group.','dominate','["dominate"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_18_dominate_gap_2','vocab_dominate','u7_18_dominate','dominate_1','gap_fill','In many countries, a small number of banks dominate the market and set the prices.','dominate','["dominate"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_18_dominate_gap_3','vocab_dominate','u7_18_dominate','dominate_1','gap_fill','The assessors noticed that Daniel tended to dominate every discussion, which made him a poor team player.','dominate','["dominate"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_19_strategy_7_meaning','vocab_strategy_7','u7_19_strategy_7','strategy_7_1','meaning_context','One useful interview strategy is to give a short example after each answer.',null,'["plan for achieving a goal"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_19_strategy_7_paraphrase','vocab_strategy_7','u7_19_strategy_7','strategy_7_1','paraphrase_context','One useful interview plan for doing well is to give a short example after each answer.','plan for doing well','["strategy"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_19_strategy_7_production','vocab_strategy_7','u7_19_strategy_7','strategy_7_1','production_context','Having a planned way of dealing with a difficulty helps candidates to stay calm when a question surprises them.','planned way of dealing with a difficulty','["strategy"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_19_strategy_7_gap_1','vocab_strategy_7','u7_19_strategy_7','strategy_7_1','gap_fill','A sensible strategy for the exam is to read all the questions first and then begin with the easiest.','strategy','["strategy"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_19_strategy_7_gap_2','vocab_strategy_7','u7_19_strategy_7','strategy_7_1','gap_fill','The company’s new recruitment strategy focuses on finding young people with excellent communication skills.','strategy','["strategy"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_19_strategy_7_gap_3','vocab_strategy_7','u7_19_strategy_7','strategy_7_1','gap_fill','Practising answers aloud with a friend is an effective strategy for reducing nerves before an interview.','strategy','["strategy"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_20_flexible_meaning','vocab_flexible','u7_20_flexible','flexible_1','meaning_context','The manager is looking for staff who are flexible when the working hours change.',null,'["able to change easily"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_20_flexible_paraphrase','vocab_flexible','u7_20_flexible','flexible_1','paraphrase_context','The manager is looking for staff who are willing to adapt when the working hours change.','willing to adapt','["flexible"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u7_20_flexible_production','vocab_flexible','u7_20_flexible','flexible_1','production_context','In a busy hospital, it is useful to be able to change easily when the day does not go as planned.','able to change easily','["flexible"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
